    {
      "id": "p0238-b008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "In Japanese entertainment, it's normal for characters to switch to an aggressive personal pronoun after turning evil or being corrupted by immense power. In this case, however, Flowey continues to use the timid pronoun boku even after becoming a god-like entity:",
        "raw": "In Japanese entertainment, it's normal for characters to switch to an aggressive\npersonal pronoun after turning evil or being corrupted by immense power. In\nthis case, however, Flowey continues to use the timid pronoun boku even after\nbecoming a god-like entity:",
